            <li><strong>Flagship:</strong> Ray 3.2 (1080p, 16 keyframes)</li>
            <li><strong>Plus tier:</strong> $30/mo, 10,000 credits</li>
            <li><strong>Pro tier:</strong> $90/mo, 40,000 credits</li>
